{'symbol': 'DLR', 'date': '2019-10-29 19:30:00', 'title': 'DIGITAL REALTY TO BUY INTERXION', 'text': "DIGITAL REALTY TO COMBINE WITH INTERXION.INTERXION HOLDING NV - INTERXION SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE A FIXED EXCHANGE RATIO OF 0.7067 DIGITAL REALTY SHARES PER INTERXION SHARE.INTERXION HOLDING NV - TRANSACTION VALUES INTERXION AT APPROXIMATELY $93.48 PER ORDINARY SHARE.INTERXION HOLDING NV - DEAL FOR APPROXIMATELY $8.4 BILLION OF TOTAL ENTERPRISE VALUE, INCLUDING ASSUMED NET DEBT.INTERXION HOLDING NV - DIGITAL REALTY CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER A. WILLIAM STEIN WILL SERVE AS CEO OF COMBINED CO.INTERXION HOLDING NV - INTERXION SHAREHOLDERS WILL OWN APPROXIMATELY 20% OF OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK OF COMBINED COMPANY.INTERXION HOLDING NV - CO'S CEO DAVID RUBERG WILL SERVE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OF COMBINED CO'S EMEA BUSINESS.INTERXION HOLDING NV - DIGITAL REALTY EXPECTS TO REFINANCE INTERXION DEBT ASSUMED IN TRANSACTION.INTERXION HOLDING NV - TRANSACTION IS NOT SUBJECT TO ANY FINANCING CONDITION.INTERXION - RUBERG IS EXPECTED TO TRANSITION OUT OF ROLE AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OF EMEA BUSINESS AT SOME POINT WITHIN ABOUT ONE YEAR OF DEAL CLOSE.INTERXION HOLDING NV - BOARD OF COMBINED COMPANY WILL CONSIST OF NINE BOARD MEMBERS DESIGNATED BY DIGITAL REALTY AND ONE BOARD MEMBER DESIGNATED BY CO.INTERXION -  LAURENCE CHAPMAN, CURRENT CHAIRMAN OF DIGITAL REALTY BOARD WILL SERVE AS CHAIRMAN OF COMBINED CO.INTERXION HOLDING NV - TRANSACTION IS EXPECTED TO BE ACCRETIVE TO LONG-TERM GROWTH TRAJECTORY OF COMBINED ORGANIZATION."}
