{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2019-10-29 12:30:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG EXEC - EXPECT SEQUENTIAL IMPROVEMENT IN GROSS PROFIT MARGIN IN Q4', 'text': 'KELLOGG CO EXEC - WE EXPECT OUR GROSS MARGIN TO DECREASE YEAR-ON-YEAR IN 2019.KELLOGG CO EXEC - WE CONTINUE TO EXPECT SEQUENTIAL IMPROVEMENT IN GROSS PROFIT MARGIN IN QUARTER 4 - CONF CALL.KELLOGG CO EXEC - SOME OF THE INVESTMENT THAT HAVE BEEN DEFERRED TO QUARTER 3 HAS NOW BEEN MOVED TO QUARTER 4 - CONF CALL.KELLOGG CO EXEC - CEREAL HAS TAKEN A LITTLE LONGER THAN ANTICIPATED TO BOUNCE BACK AFTER WE PULLED BACK INVESTMENT IN FIRST HALF TO EXECUTE  PACK SIZE HARMONIZATION.KELLOGG CO EXEC - WE ARE NOT WHERE WE NEED TO BE YET IN NORTH AMERICA CEREAL BUT WE ARE ON IT.KELLOGG CO EXEC ON CEREAL BUSINESS - WE EXPECT GRADUAL IMPROVEMENT IN Q4 AND INTO 2020.KELLOGG CO EXEC - MORNINGSTAR FARMS, PLANT-BASED MEAT ALTERNATIVES BRAND, ACCELERATED ITS CONSUMPTION GROWTH TO 11% & GAINED MORE THAN A FULL SHARE POINT.KELLOGG CO EXEC - WE ARE EXTREMELY EXCITED ABOUT OUR NEW LAUNCH (PLANT-BASED MEAT ALTERNATIVE) INCOGNITO IN Q1 2020.KELLOGG CO EXEC - CEREAL IN THE UNITED STATES IS JOB #1 IN TERMS OF WHAT WE HAVE NOT DELIVERED RELATIVE TO OUR PERFORMANCE ACROSS THE BOARD.KELLOGG CO EXEC - FROM A GROSS MARGIN PERSPECTIVE, WE ARE NOT WHERE WE WANT TO BE.KELLOGG CO EXEC - 1% OF DIVESTITURE IMPACT WOULD PROBABLY SHIFT INTO THE NEXT YEAR.KELLOGG CO EXEC ON COMMODITIES - WE SHOULD BE LOOKING AT LITTLE LESS INFLATION IN 2020 COMPARED TO 2019.KELLOGG CO EXEC ON BREXIT IMPACT - WE ARE PREPARING AS BEST WE POSSIBLY CAN.'}
